  - Machine note (2026-11-09): CUBIOMES_GPU_PROFILING=1 degrades to
    unprofiled on this workstation. Deepin's nvidia-libopencl1
    580.119.02 loader accepts CL_QUEUE_PROFILING_ENABLE (it even reads
    back set through clCreateCommandQueue) yet answers every
    clGetEventProfilingInfo with CL_PROFILING_INFO_NOT_AVAILABLE (-7) for
